// The Gilded Legion (docs/DECKS.md, section 12, batch 1, card 7): a national building. When built,
// choose one civilization you have met (`SPELL_GILDED_LEGION`, cast by a unit in the city at a player
// of that civilization: the choice is the city's, `City::legion_civ`). The city can train that
// civilization's versions of each unit class (its unique units; not heroes or world units) at 150%
// of their cost, with their own building prerequisites (`legion_cost_percent`; rules:
// crates/ffh-core/src/ffh/cards/battle_more.rs).
