    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_GILDED_LEGION_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Allows the Gilded Legion (national building, 250 [ICON_PRODUCTION]).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Once it is built, choose a civilization you have met (the Gilded Legion action of a unit in the city). The city then trains that civilization's unit of each class (its unique units; not world units), with its own prerequisites, at 150% of its cost.",
